WEBVTT

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:40.150
Wow! Everything is frozen!

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.610
There's no geothermal heat in this area, see?

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.090
It's an eternal glacier.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:46.950
You can see it now. Over there.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.580
That's Moosehead.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:51.630
You can probably see the town 
out at the edge of the glacier.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:59.380
So that's Blue Notes Blues...

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.050
Then it was around here, 
right? Where Gauche...

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.380
I mean... where you saw Noir...

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.640
Yeah... You don't see travelers 
on foot around these parts.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.390
I remember like it was yesterday,

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:19.350
that man dressed like a raven 
with some pure-white woman.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:27.760
In north Yodaka, near Blue Notes Blues,

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:31.180
a sea-lion-carriage driver saw 
someone who fits Noir's description.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:37.170
Then, in the direction the man disappeared, 
the driver saw a bright light shine.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.280
It was probably the light from a shindan.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.980
A shindan strong enough to 
light up the entire sky?

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.870
That would have to be...

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.870
If it's Noir, then what 
is he doing in the north?

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.830
With your power to see the 
heart contained within objects,

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.320
you might be able to find the answer.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.620
Then...

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:02.580
Yes. Head to the north 
right away, Lag Seeing.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.580
Yes!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.200
Polite and prompt, as usual.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.850
Blue Notes Blues, huh?

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.880
I wonder what kind of place it is, Niche?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.970
Blue Notes Blues... Indeed, it 
is a quite fascinating place...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.020
D-Dr. Thunderland!

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.180
You mustn't, Niche!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:31.810
There are people still there 
who have witnessed the Maka.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.260
The Maka?

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:40.020
If I could awaken the blood of 
Maka that flows in your dingo,

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.420
and finally show the world 
such a great, new power...

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:47.200
Niche, have you heard of Blue Notes Blues?

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.110
Blue?

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.540
No!

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:02.530
Awaken the blood of Maka... My research...

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.360
S-Sorry, Doctor!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.600
Let's go, Niche.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.340
Lag!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:13.890
Connor, Zazie...

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.680
Lag, I heard you're heading to the north?

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.360
There aren't any routes up there, and...

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.820
Listen up, Lag. My next 
delivery is also up north.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:26.190
I'll go through Blue Notes 
Blues for you instead.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:27.370
Zazie?

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:31.320
You can't... See, I'm not 
going on a delivery, I'm...

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:34.140
There's reports of Noir in the area, right?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.770
So, what'll you do if you run into Noir?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.450
What'll I do?

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.660
I'll bring his heart back.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:45.990
Bring it back? Have you written the 
letter for the letter bullet yet?

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.350
Well, I...

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.500
I haven't written it yet!

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.620
I've stayed up all night trying 
to write it again and again,

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:58.940
but each time I'm about to write 
it, there's just so much...

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.160
In the end, I was never able to write it.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.060
Well, just leave it to me.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:07.490
I'll kick that no heart Noir's butt!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:12.160
You can't! Gauche still has 
some heart left in him!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.290
He does? How do you know that?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.590
Because...

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.800
Because I believe in Gauche.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:24.950
Lag!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:30.530
Zazie, why are you picking on him like that?

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:42.360
Wow... The ice really does look like antlers.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.220
Why would Gauche have shot 
a shindan around here?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:51.180
And that's a lake... This 
place really feels mysterious.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.120
It's no wonder the Maka 
legend comes from here.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.500
Niche!

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.720
And she's off!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.130
Niche...

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.750
A gaichuu?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.540
But...

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.710
Wait... Was Gauche's shindan for this?

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:46.370
If that's the case, it should 
be shattered into pieces.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.860
And besides, look at the size...

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.660
I don't recognize this one 
from the Gaichuu Encyclopedia.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:56.220
The sea-lion driver didn't 
say anything about this.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.770
A cartridge?

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.450
Could it be Gauche's?

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:06.050
If this is from Gauche's shindanjuu,

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.850
then a fragment of Gauche's 
heart should remain within it.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.910
Please, show me Gauche's heart!

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.490
Resound, Red Needle!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.630
What did you say? The letters were stolen?

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:42.020
I go to six towns, and I end 
up collecting less than half.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.840
This ain't right, Wasiolka.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.410
Lag...

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:53.780
He should be okay since Niche is with him,
but when it comes to Gauche-san, he's...

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:08.250
You there. I don't know who 
you are, but I'm in bad mood.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.680
You got some business with me, you 
got 10 seconds to show yourself!

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:15.820
1! 2! 3!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.750
456789, 10!

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:19.210
Time's up!

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.510
Blue Thorn!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:29.770
My name is Noir. I will steal your letters.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.730
Hell if you...

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.390
Resound, Gymnopédie!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.050
I feel something isn't right.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.650
Oww...

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:13.890
That's...

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:19.280
The fragment of Gauche's heart 
that remained in the cartridge.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.340
Where am I?

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:34.840
Your hand.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.190
So, you're awake?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.430
Who are you?

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:00.070
It seems you don't remember.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.220
I am Lawrence.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:07.760
Gauche Suede, let us give 
thanks for your safe return.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.040
Gauche Suede...?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.630
Who is that?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.670
What a pitiful man you are...

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.840
Not only the memories of your mother,

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:26.610
but your entire heart is lost, yes?

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:30.850
That's the real "One 
unable to become Spirit!"

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:34.680
Even so, you should still be joyous.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:38.730
You shall change this 
world in concert with us.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:43.870
As the sole person who returned 
alive from the light.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.690
Light?

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:51.870
This girl will now take the 
role of looking after you.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:56.180
She was born in the place 
in which I once existed.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.290
Use her as you see fit.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:16.400
I won't give them to you! You 
poor excuse for Gauche Suede!

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.450
Go to sleep there.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.950
I...

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:37.680
I know what it's like when someone 
loses their entire heart...

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.510
My parents' hearts were eaten by the gaichuu.

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:48.130
They lost their entire hearts! There 
was no way to bring them back!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.110
I won't let Lag experience that!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:55.530
No way am I going to let you get close 
to Lag, with your heart gone like this!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:00.820
Gauche...

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.540
Is this a church?

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:18.230
Here in Amberground, only the chosen 
who live in the capital Akatsuki

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:21.200
are able to experience the 
richness of the artificial sun.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.240
As you head away from the center,

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.940
it is wrapped more and more in deep darkness.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.100
Why is such an unfair system unchallenged?

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:30.990
The government decides it all.

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.600
You were once used by that government.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:37.770
As a National Postal Delivery Worker, a Bee.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:38.900
I was?

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:46.490
Soon! Soon the time for 
us to stand up will come!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:51.630
We will strike down the conceited 
residents of Akatsuki,

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.680
and construct a new world of equality!

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.500
Behold!

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:01.130
He is the sole person to 
return alive from the light.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.010
He is power that has been bestowed upon us!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.320
Reverse!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.010
Reverse!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:12.790
Reverse! Reverse! Reverse! Reverse!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.020
I lost my heart in that light.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:20.790
Oh, yes... I haven't asked you your name.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.410
I have no name.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.030
Then you and I are the same.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.410
I have a favor to ask.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:37.390
Will you show me the place 
I was once Gauche Suede?

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:05.840
Don't worry! I can do everything 
by myself and go anywhere I want.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:43.610
What's the matter?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.860
I can hear it...

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.630
She ran away from there...

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.680
What is this?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:13.550
They perform experiments in Akatsuki.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:15.760
They combine humans with 
all manner of things,

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.100
in order to recreate the ancient Spirits.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.970
But they were all failures.

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:23.600
The failures are disposed of.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:28.670
And even those who manage to escape... 
Only a handful survive for long.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.650
And you escaped?

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.920
At the least, we should 
give her a proper grave.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:41.080
Yes.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:52.280
Gauche... I think it's about 
time I returned this to you.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:55.800
Your shindanjuu, Gymnopédie.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.150
Even if your memories don't return,

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:03.700
as long as your heart recovers, you should 
be able to shoot a shindan once again.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.060
And at that time...

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:13.460
Tell me. What should I do?

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.820
Incredible! Just incredible, Gauche!

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:17.820
Stop.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.820
Don't use that name again.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:25.670
Gauche Suede is no more.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.390
Then how about I give you a name?

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:37.170
Your name is Noir.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:40.680
My marauder!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.680
Noir? Darkness?

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.640
Yes... Light is my enemy.

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:53.820
Gauche... Did you really 
lose your entire heart?

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:55.900
Noir!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:21.100
This... Noir's memories?

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.230
Noir? Yeah, right...

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:33.230
Lag said he's gonna bring back your heart!

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:36.360
Ow!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:44.060
I may have lost today...

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.830
Just for today, that is!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.270
Lag, where are you?

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.350
You don't have a name either, right?

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.440
Do you mind if I give you one?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:10.850
No.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:14.800
Roda... Let me call you Roda.

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:19.550
I don't know what it means, but 
it popped into my head just now.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.370
Roda...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.820
It's not gone! He does remember, 
even if only a little!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:34.090
I know I can bring it back! Gauche 
hasn't lost his entire heart!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.970
Lag!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.330
Niche!

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:50.060
The heart in the cartridge 
only went up to so far.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.810
I wasn't able to see what he was 
doing with that empty shell.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.500
Okay then... Let's head to the town!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.230
We'll ask what Gauche was doing here!

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:00.210
The town?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.670
Niche, that's the wrong direction!

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:06.110
The town is on the other side of the lake!

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:10.810
This way is better! The ice is 
thin and dangerous the other way!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:14.330
Niche... Why do you know that?

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.260
I was born in that village.

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:21.210
About 200 years ago.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:41.030
Next: Blue Notes Blues
